{"seq":2,"slug":"piece-table","title":"Piece Table 片段表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/editor-architecture/text-buffer/piece-table","wordCount":1077,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"piece-table-片段表\">Piece Table 片段表</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Piece Table 用「永不修改原文、只描述片段」的思路，把文本表示成一段段指向不可变缓冲区的引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>双缓冲区</strong>：Original Buffer（只读，文件打开时的内容）+ Add Buffer（追加写入，所有新增文本），两者都不被修改。</li>\n<li><strong>Piece 描述符</strong>：一个 <code>(buffer, start, length)</code> 三元组，指向某个缓冲区的一个区间；创建与拆分成本极低，不复制文本。</li>\n<li><strong>编辑只动描述符</strong>：插入 = 追加文本到 Add Buffer + 拆分/插入 Piece；删除 = 调整或移除 Piece 边界。</li>\n<li><strong>红黑树索引</strong>：VS Code 用红黑树组织 Piece，节点维护 <code>leftLen</code>（左子树字符数）与 <code>leftLFCnt</code>（换行数），实现 O(log n) 的偏移定位与行号映射。</li>\n<li><strong>append-only 的架构红利</strong>：撤销只需反转描述符操作、快照只需拷贝 Piece 列表、Add Buffer 天然是一份完整的编辑日志。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"什么是-piece-table\">什么是 Piece Table</h2><p>Piece Table 是一种追加写入（append-only）的文本缓冲区数据结构，最早由 J Strother Moore 于 1983 年提出。VS Code 自 2018 年起采用 Piece Table 作为核心文本缓冲区实现，替代了此前基于行数组的方案。</p>\n<p>Piece Table 的核心理念极其优雅：永远不修改原始文本，只记录&quot;文本由哪些片段组成&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>可变性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Original Buffer</td>\n<td>存储文件打开时的原始内容</td>\n<td>只读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Add Buffer</td>\n<td>存储所有后续新增的文本</td>\n<td>追加写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Piece 描述符表</td>\n<td>有序列表，描述最终文本的片段组成</td>\n<td>可修改</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    PT[&quot;Piece Table&quot;] --&gt; OB[&quot;Original Buffer&lt;br/&gt;&#39;Hello World&#39;&lt;br/&gt;只读&quot;]&#10;    PT --&gt; AB[&quot;Add Buffer&lt;br/&gt;&#39;Beautiful &#39;&lt;br/&gt;追加写入&quot;]&#10;    PT --&gt; PL[&quot;Piece 列表&quot;]&#10;    PL --&gt; P1[Piece 1&lt;br/&gt;original[0..6]&quot;]&#10;    PL --&gt; P2[Piece 2&lt;br/&gt;add[0..10]&quot;]&#10;    PL --&gt; P3[Piece 3&lt;br/&gt;original[6..11]&quot;]\">graph LR\n    PT[\"Piece Table\"] --&gt; OB[\"Original Buffer&lt;br/&gt;'Hello World'&lt;br/&gt;只读\"]\n    PT --&gt; AB[\"Add Buffer&lt;br/&gt;'Beautiful '&lt;br/&gt;追加写入\"]\n    PT --&gt; PL[\"Piece 列表\"]\n    PL --&gt; P1[Piece 1&lt;br/&gt;original[0..6]\"]\n    PL --&gt; P2[Piece 2&lt;br/&gt;add[0..10]\"]\n    PL --&gt; P3[Piece 3&lt;br/&gt;original[6..11]\"]</pre><p>上例表示将 <code>&quot;Hello World&quot;</code> 修改为 <code>&quot;Hello Beautiful World&quot;</code> 后的状态。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"片段描述符设计\">片段描述符设计</h2><p>每个 Piece 描述符是一个轻量结构，指向某个缓冲区的一个区间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type BufferKind = &#39;original&#39; | &#39;add&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface Piece {&#10;  buffer: BufferKind;&#10;  start: number;&#10;  length: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface PieceTable {&#10;  original: string;&#10;  add: string;&#10;  pieces: Piece[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createPieceTable(content: string): PieceTable {&#10;  return {&#10;    original: content,&#10;    add: &#39;&#39;,&#10;    pieces: [{ buffer: &#39;original&#39;, start: 0, length: content.length }],&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function getText(table: PieceTable): string {&#10;  let result = &#39;&#39;;&#10;  for (const piece of table.pieces) {&#10;    const buf = piece.buffer === &#39;original&#39; ? table.original : table.add;&#10;    result += buf.slice(piece.start, piece.start + piece.length);&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BufferKind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'original'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'add'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Piece</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  buffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BufferKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PieceTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  original</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  add</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pieces</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Piece</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createPieceTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PieceTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    original: content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    add: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pieces: [{ buffer: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'original'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, start: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, length: content.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">table</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PieceTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> piece</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> table.pieces) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> piece.buffer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'original'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> table.original </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> table.add;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buf.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(piece.start, piece.start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> piece.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键特性：Piece 描述符只存储偏移量和长度，不复制任何文本内容，因此创建和拆分 Piece 的成本极低。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>buffer</td>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td>1 byte</td>\n<td>指向 original 或 add</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>start</td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>4 bytes</td>\n<td>缓冲区内的起始偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>length</td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>4 bytes</td>\n<td>片段长度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> VS Code 的实际实现中，Piece 描述符还存储了行号信息（行起始偏移数组的索引），用于加速行号到偏移量的转换。这是一个以空间换时间的经典优化。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"插入与删除操作\">插入与删除操作</h2><p>插入操作只需三步：将新文本追加到 Add Buffer，拆分受影响的 Piece，插入新的 Piece 描述符。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function insert(table: PieceTable, offset: number, text: string): void {&#10;  const addStart = table.add.length;&#10;  table.add += text;&#10;&#10;  const newPiece: Piece = { buffer: &#39;add&#39;, start: addStart, length: text.length };&#10;&#10;  let pos = 0;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; table.pieces.length; i++) {&#10;    const piece = table.pieces[i];&#10;    if (pos + piece.length &gt;= offset) {&#10;      const splitAt = offset - pos;&#10;      if (splitAt === 0) {&#10;        table.pieces.splice(i, 0, newPiece);&#10;      } else if (splitAt === piece.length) {&#10;        table.pieces.splice(i + 1, 0, newPiece);&#10;      } else {&#10;        const left: Piece = { buffer: piece.buffer, start: piece.start, length: splitAt };&#10;        const right: Piece = {&#10;          buffer: piece.buffer,&#10;          start: piece.start + splitAt,&#10;          length: piece.length - splitAt,&#10;        };&#10;        table.pieces.splice(i, 1, left, newPiece, right);&#10;      }&#10;      return;&#10;    }&#10;    pos += piece.length;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  table.pieces.push(newPiece);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function remove(table: PieceTable, offset: number, length: number): void {&#10;  let pos = 0;&#10;  let remaining = length;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; table.pieces.length &amp;&amp; remaining &gt; 0; i++) {&#10;    const piece = table.pieces[i];&#10;    if (pos + piece.length &lt;= offset) {&#10;      pos += piece.length;&#10;      continue;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    const pieceOffset = Math.max(0, offset - pos);&#10;    const removeLen = Math.min(remaining, piece.length - pieceOffset);&#10;&#10;    if (pieceOffset === 0 &amp;&amp; removeLen === piece.length) {&#10;      table.pieces.splice(i, 1);&#10;      i--;&#10;    } else if (pieceOffset === 0) {&#10;      piece.start += removeLen;&#10;      piece.length -= removeLen;&#10;    } else if (pieceOffset + rem